<BaseLayout>
  <section class="intro">
    <h1>
      I’m a PhD student in computer science at Princeton, advised by Sanjeev Arora.
    </h1>
    <p>
      My research focuses on how machine learning systems generalize beyond their training
      data. I’m particularly interested in self-improving models, synthetic data, and
      automated research.
    </p>
